					"content": "那個東西是！？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110503
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110503,
					"content": "（鎖鏈層層纏繞，懸吊在空中，散發著不祥的氣息…沒錯，和「污穢逆位神像」非常類似！）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110504
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110504,
					"content": "（果然和深淵教團有關係嗎？這些正在膜拜的丘丘人，也像極了當時的「那個傢伙」…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110505
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110505,
					"content": "埃德，這裡很不吉利，快走！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110506
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110506,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110507,
					"content": "埃德？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110508
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110508,
					"content": "…生命啊，為何在跪拜呢，因恐懼未知而跪拜？因貪圖力量而跪拜？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "合成"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110509,
					"content": "（什麼聲音，好像從我頭腦裡傳來的…埃德，好像聽不到？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110510
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110510,
					"content": "…生命啊，為何在跪拜呢，我又不是什麼神明，我只是——「罪人」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "合成"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110511,
					"content": "（「罪人」…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110512
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110512,
					"content": "#誕生於罪孽，但尚且無垢的花朵啊，我通曉{F#妳}{M#你}的命運。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "合成"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110513,
					"content": "#無需壓抑{F#妳}{M#你}一切的不甘，無需容忍那全部的謊言。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "合成"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110514,
					"content": "去成為「超然」的存在吧，超越一切「被賦予的命運」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "合成"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110515,
					"content": "#我將在時間的盡頭垂淚…回望{F#妳}{M#你}的一切。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "合成"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110516,
					"content": "（…你究竟是誰，這些話是什麼意思？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110517
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110517,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "合成"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110518,
					"content": "（聲音…消失了嗎…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110519
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110519,
					"content": "！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110520
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110520,
					"content": "…埃德？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110521
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110521,
					"content": "呼…呼…剛才發生了什麼事？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110522,
					"content": "我好像見到那東西的瞬間，內心所有的情緒都平息了，只剩下說不出是敬畏…還是幸福的感覺。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110523,
					"content": "你現在沒事了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110524
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110524,
					"content": "沒事，我感覺很好，不如說…比剛進來這裡的時候要好多了，真是奇怪…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110525,
					"content": "這裡有問題，我們趕快離開吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80110526
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80110526,
					"content": "#是、是嗎…好吧，那先聽{F#妳}{M#你}的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80110527,
					"content": "你們從詭異的洞穴離開後，直接回到了埃德的小屋…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 801106,
